1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:11,423
BBC News reports that the United States has imposed new tariffs on 60 trading partners, including China, the European Union and the United Kingdom.

2
00:00:11,373 --> 00:00:19,667
The duties range from 10% to 12.5% and replace a temporary tariff that expired on Friday.

3
00:00:19,667 --> 00:00:28,094
Washington links the measure to forced-labour concerns, but critics expect higher costs for importers and consumers.

